        <div class="timeline">

            <!-- 1889 -->

            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-card">

                    <span class="timeline-year">1889</span>

                    <h3>The Birth of a Legacy</h3>

                    <p>
                        Mohun Bagan Athletic Club was established
                        in Kolkata, beginning a remarkable journey
                        in Indian football.
                    </p>

                    <p class="bengali">
                        কলকাতায় মোহন বাগান অ্যাথলেটিক ক্লাবের
                        প্রতিষ্ঠা।
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- 1911 -->

            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-card">

                    <span class="timeline-year">1911</span>

                    <h3>The Historic IFA Shield Victory</h3>

                    <p>
                        Mohun Bagan defeated the East Yorkshire
                        Regiment 2–1 in the IFA Shield final.
                        The team became the first Indian club
                        to win the tournament.
                    </p>

                    <p class="bengali">
                        ১৯১১ সালের ঐতিহাসিক আইএফএ শিল্ড জয়।
                        ভারতীয় ফুটবলের ইতিহাসে এক স্মরণীয় অধ্যায়।
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- 1947 -->

            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-card">

                    <span class="timeline-year">1947</span>

                    <h3>Independence Era</h3>

                    <p>
                        Following India's independence, Mohun Bagan
                        continued to strengthen its place in the
                        country's football culture.
                    </p>

                    <p class="bengali">
                        স্বাধীনতার পরেও ভারতীয় ফুটবলে
                        মোহন বাগানের ঐতিহ্য অব্যাহত থাকে।
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- 1977 -->

            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-card">

                    <span class="timeline-year">1977</span>

                    <h3>A Memorable International Encounter</h3>

                    <p>
                        Mohun Bagan played against the famous
                        New York Cosmos side featuring Pelé.
                        The match became a memorable event
                        in Indian football history.
                    </p>

                    <p class="bengali">
                        পেলের নিউ ইয়র্ক কসমস দলের বিরুদ্ধে
                        ঐতিহাসিক ম্যাচ।
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- 1990 -->

            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-card">

                    <span class="timeline-year">1990</span>

                    <h3>Continued Domestic Success</h3>

                    <p>
                        Mohun Bagan continued to compete at the
                        highest level of Indian football,
                        building on its rich domestic tradition.
                    </p>

                    <p class="bengali">
                        জাতীয় স্তরে সাফল্য এবং প্রতিযোগিতার
                        ধারাবাহিকতা।
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- 2020 -->

            <div class="timeline-item">

                <div class="timeline-card">

                    <span class="timeline-year">2020</span>

                    <h3>Entry into the Indian Super League Era</h3>

                    <p>
                        The club entered a new chapter through
                        its association with ATK, competing in
                        the Indian Super League as ATK Mohun Bagan.
